{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天星期六。", "text_idx": 120, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和纱凪来到街上，\\n一起给理央买圣诞礼物。", "text_idx": 121, "plain": "我和纱凪来到街上，一起给理央买圣诞礼物。", "plain_idx": 122, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～果然还是挽另一边好些吧？」", "text_idx": 124, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4359", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过这边挽起来倒挺方便的……」", "text_idx": 126, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4360", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们挽着手臂，先逛逛橱窗。", "text_idx": 128, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪正烦恼着到底要挽我的右手还是左手。", "text_idx": 129, "plain": "纱凪正烦恼着到底要挽我的右手还是左手。", "plain_idx": 129, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，还是这边吧」", "text_idx": 130, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4361", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后选择了我的右手。", "text_idx": 132, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为穿着男装，纱凪今天十分积极。", "text_idx": 133, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来，\\n　今天这算不算我们在一起之后第一次约会啊」", "text_idx": 134, "plain": "「说起来，　今天这算不算我们在一起之后第一次约会啊」", "plain_idx": 135, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4362", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你这么说好像也确实」", "text_idx": 137, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "或许是因为之前和她一起去买过社团活动的用品，\\n所以现在并没有多少在约会的感觉。", "text_idx": 138, "plain": "或许是因为之前和她一起去买过社团活动的用品，所以现在并没有多少在约会的感觉。", "plain_idx": 139, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，像这样堂堂正正地挽着手臂走在街上，\\n确实还是第一次。", "text_idx": 140, "plain": "不过，像这样堂堂正正地挽着手臂走在街上，确实还是第一次。", "plain_idx": 141, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎嘿嘿，感觉还挺好的♪」", "text_idx": 142, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4363", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也是这么想的。", "text_idx": 144, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有些害羞，但也有些骄傲。", "text_idx": 145, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天的纱凪，看起来比往日都要更加耀眼一些。", "text_idx": 146, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过在别人眼里，咱俩男的手挽着手，\\n　看起来会不会有点怪？」", "text_idx": 147, "plain": "「不过在别人眼里，咱俩男的手挽着手，　看起来会不会有点怪？」", "plain_idx": 148, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4364", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不清楚。\\n　如果把你当成男生，可能还真是……」", "text_idx": 150, "plain": "「不清楚。　如果把你当成男生，可能还真是……」", "plain_idx": 151, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不管怎么看我都是个男生嘛。\\n　你看，胸部也平平的」", "text_idx": 152, "plain": "「不管怎么看我都是个男生嘛。　你看，胸部也平平的」", "plain_idx": 153, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4365", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一开始也把她当成了理央的“哥哥”，\\n所以也说不出什么反驳的话语。", "text_idx": 155, "plain": "我一开始也把她当成了理央的“哥哥”，所以也说不出什么反驳的话语。", "plain_idx": 156, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可是现在的纱凪，在我眼中不管怎么看都是一个可爱的女孩子。", "text_idx": 157, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而我也自恋又骄傲地相信，是我使她变成了现在这个样子。", "text_idx": 158, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你不打算安慰一下我关于胸部的问题吗？」", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4366", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我感觉你胸部也没有那么小，不用太在意」", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的吗？好嘞～从今天开始我就自称是巨乳咯♪」", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4367", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪一露出笑容，\\n我便有种周围温度升高了两三度的错觉。", "text_idx": 164, "plain": "纱凪一露出笑容，我便有种周围温度升高了两三度的错觉。", "plain_idx": 165, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "果然，我们俩并不像男同。", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……啊，不过我不被当成男生就没意义了」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4368", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾在和男生交往，\\n　这种传闻要是传出去了那多有意思呀」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": "「新吾在和男生交往，　这种传闻要是传出去了那多有意思呀」", "plain_idx": 170, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4369", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要用别人的事情取乐啊」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为，这种传闻要是流传开了，\\n　就不会有奇怪的虫子凑到你身边了，不挺好的嘛♪」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": "「因为，这种传闻要是流传开了，　就不会有奇怪的虫子凑到你身边了，不挺好的嘛♪」", "plain_idx": 174, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4370", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不许吐槽我是奇怪的虫子」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4371", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪的表情来回变化着，\\n拽着我的胳膊向前走去。", "text_idx": 178, "plain": "纱凪的表情来回变化着，拽着我的胳膊向前走去。", "plain_idx": 179, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "仅是看着她这副模样，我就感觉内心得到了治愈。", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总之，先去给理央买礼物吧」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": "「总之，先去给理央买礼物吧」", "plain_idx": 181, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来我们本来就是来买礼物的来着」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4372", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不知不觉开始享受约会了♪」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4373", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那样也不错就是了」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，那个那个，你看，那件衣服，是不是很可爱？」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4374", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一次也好，\\n　我也想穿穿那种轻飘飘的衣服呀」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": "「一次也好，　我也想穿穿那种轻飘飘的衣服呀」", "plain_idx": 190, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4375", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你去试试不就行了，我感觉挺适合你的」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不行不行。那种衣服，\\n　得要美羽学姐那种类型的女生来穿才可爱」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": "「不行不行。那种衣服，　得要美羽学姐那种类型的女生来穿才可爱」", "plain_idx": 194, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4376", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，对面那件衣服也好可爱。\\n　新吾你看，这里这里」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": "「啊，对面那件衣服也好可爱。　新吾你看，这里这里」", "plain_idx": 197, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4377", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她时左时右地来回拽着我的胳膊，\\n我们两人慢慢逛着街。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": "她时左时右地来回拽着我的胳膊，我们两人慢慢逛着街。", "plain_idx": 200, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "仅仅是回想起自己昨天曾吻了这女孩的脸颊，\\n我的脸就不住地发烫。", "text_idx": 201, "plain": "仅仅是回想起自己昨天曾吻了这女孩的脸颊，我的脸就不住地发烫。", "plain_idx": 202, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪啊」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，怎么了？」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4378", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你的虎牙，很可爱呢」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎，虎牙？」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4379", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你笑起来的时候，我感觉好可爱」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4380", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是么。我还是第一次听人这么说」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4381", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过你这么一说，\\n　我都有点不好意思笑了」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": "「不过你这么一说，　我都有点不好意思笑了」", "plain_idx": 215, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4382", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你感觉不好意思的表情也很可爱」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎……」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4383", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你现在稍微有点惊讶的表情也可爱」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不、不用这么使劲夸我，\\n　我都有点不知道该摆出什么表情了」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": "「不、不用这么使劲夸我，　我都有点不知道该摆出什么表情了」", "plain_idx": 222, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4384", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和之前一样，她依然对自己有多可爱毫无自知。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说实话，正常来说是没有男人会对她弃之不顾的。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "按照隼太说的，\\n她在班级里也有许多隐藏粉丝……", "text_idx": 226, "plain": "按照隼太说的，她在班级里也有许多隐藏粉丝……", "plain_idx": 227, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1753", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4385", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪突然停下了脚步。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后近处传来了一个耳熟的声音。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哟，碰上新鲜事了」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1754", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。你也是来买东西的吗？」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，算是吧」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1755", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太出现后，纱凪放开了我的胳膊。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后将帽子压得更深，藏到了我的背后。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，一到这个时期人就多起来了啊」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1756", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟圣诞节快到了」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太应该也注意到了纱凪，\\n但他并没有刻意与她接触。", "text_idx": 244, "plain": "隼太应该也注意到了纱凪，但他并没有刻意与她接触。", "plain_idx": 245, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "关于这个，还有着另一个原因——", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呦，抱歉。我们稍微有点急」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1757", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「回头见，新吾」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1758", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太刚迈开步子，\\n一位像纱凪一样藏在他身后的女生就小跑着跟了上去。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": "隼太刚迈开步子，一位像纱凪一样藏在他身后的女生就小跑着跟了上去。", "plain_idx": 253, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太也是和别人一起来的，\\n我们彼此也都很明白气氛。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": "隼太也是和别人一起来的，我们彼此也都很明白气氛。", "plain_idx": 255, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那个女生难道是椋梨的女朋友？」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4386", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，是啊」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4387", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……怎么了？」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事，我就是以为，\\n　椋梨应该会喜欢那种更高调些的女生……」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": "「没事，我就是以为，　椋梨应该会喜欢那种更高调些的女生……」", "plain_idx": 262, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4388", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太外表看起来就是这样的，\\n纱凪会这么想也不是不能理解。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": "隼太外表看起来就是这样的，纱凪会这么想也不是不能理解。", "plain_idx": 265, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感觉是个特别文静的女生呢」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4389", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从外表是高调还是朴素来评价，那女生应该属于后者。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，不知怎么地，感觉他们两个很合适啊，\\n　或者说是看起来很般配吗……」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": "「不过，不知怎么地，感觉他们两个很合适啊，　或者说是看起来很般配吗……」", "plain_idx": 270, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4390", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「两人并肩一起走着显得很自然，\\n　我就感觉他俩真好啊……」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": "「两人并肩一起走着显得很自然，　我就感觉他俩真好啊……」", "plain_idx": 273, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4391", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那是家里长辈给他决定的未婚妻，\\n　好像已经在一起很久了」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": "「那是家里长辈给他决定的未婚妻，　好像已经在一起很久了」", "plain_idx": 276, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎，这样啊……」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4392", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4393", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看着隼太他们走远之后，纱凪突然没了精神。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是累了吗？」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有。只是稍微有点泄气」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4394", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「泄气？为什么？」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为，我这一副男生的打扮，\\n　就不能像他们两人一样……」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "「因为，我这一副男生的打扮，　就不能像他们两人一样……」", "plain_idx": 286, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4395", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有没有一天，我也能变成像椋梨的女朋友那样的女孩呢」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4396", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我能不能成为，\\n　和你并肩走在一起也显得很自然的女孩呢……」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": "「我能不能成为，　和你并肩走在一起也显得很自然的女孩呢……」", "plain_idx": 291, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4397", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪似乎认为，我们现在并不像他们那样自然。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「他们是他们，我们是我们」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们继续买东西吧？」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4398", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「去那家店看看布偶吧」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们这回就挑一个比上次那个生日礼物更大的布偶吧」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": "「我们这回就挑一个比上次那个生日礼物更大的布偶吧」", "plain_idx": 298, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，那可以让我来选吗？」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4399", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么，有看上的了？」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我看到一个外形有点像熊喵的超大布偶」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": "「嗯，我看到一个外形有点像熊喵的超大布偶」", "plain_idx": 302, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4400", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像是布偶之王？叫什么来着……\\n　总之，你看到之后会被它的大小震撼到的」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": "「好像是布偶之王？叫什么来着……　总之，你看到之后会被它的大小震撼到的」", "plain_idx": 305, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4401", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我就拭目以待」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就走吧，这边这边」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4402", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好好好，但是你的虎牙真的好可爱」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「别管虎牙啦，去看布偶之王♪」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4403", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后，我们买了那个传说中的巨大布偶作为理央的礼物。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": "最后，我们买了那个传说中的巨大布偶作为理央的礼物。", "plain_idx": 313, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那是个大大的、圆滚滚的，还带着王冠的神秘生物。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "它那尺寸实在太大，以至于想要藏到圣诞节当天都有些困难。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
